  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rvaltningsreform Serbie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HRM Serbia - Publ Adm Ref Ser Year 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">APAD har efterfr&#xe5;gat svenskt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r reformprocessen av Serbiens f&#xf6;rvaltning med inriktning p&#xe5; personal organisation. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att introducera ett modernt HRM system i Serbien.  Projekttiden &#xe4;r planerad till ter &#xe5;r och den f&#xf6;rsta fasen (&#xe5;ret) inriktas p&#xe5; att etablera en informationsbas om Serbiens ministeriers och myndigheters personal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APAD has requested Swedish support for the adm reform process of Serbia regarding Human Resource Management (HRM). The overall project objective is the introduction of a modern HRM system in the  Government of Serbia.It is anticipated that co-operation shall be ongoing for a period of three years. The first phase aims to establish a platform of knowledge about Serbian ministerial personel</narrative>
  </description>
